---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import StateLots from '../../components/StateLots.astro';
import { href } from '../../lib/data';
import { breadcrumbNode, faqNode, pageGraph, webPageNode } from '../../lib/schema';

const title = 'Can a Georgia HOA ban RV parking? | RV Storage Prices';
const description =
  'No Georgia statute was found that requires a property owners’ association to allow or forbid an RV or boat. The code text was not quoted. Not legal advice.';
const path = '/guides/can-hoa-ban-rv-parking-georgia/';
const crumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { label: 'Guides', path: '/guides/' },
  { label: 'Georgia HOA parking', path },
];
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Can a Georgia HOA ban RV parking?',
    a: 'On November 19, 2026, no Georgia statute was found that names a recreational vehicle, motor home, boat, or driveway parking rule as something a property owners’ association must allow or must forbid. That is not a statement that an association may not adopt a rule.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Why is the Property Owners’ Association Act not quoted here?',
    a: 'The Georgia General Assembly laws page did not return the code text during that review, so the rules page does not quote a section. Secondary reprints were not used as the statute.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Where is RV storage in Georgia?',
    a: 'The city list on this page links the Georgia storage lots in this directory. A listing is not a reading of a recorded instrument.',
  },
];
const schema = pageGraph([
  webPageNode({ title, description, path, dateModified: '2026-11-20' }),
  breadcrumbNode(crumbs),
  faqNode(faqs),
]);
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path={path} schema={schema}>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <Breadcrumbs items={crumbs} />
    <h1>Can a Georgia HOA ban RV parking?</h1>
    <p>
      This is not legal advice. On November 19, 2026, no Georgia statute was found that names a
      recreational vehicle, motor home, boat, or driveway parking rule as something a property owners’
      association must allow or must forbid. The longer note is the
      <a href={href('/rules/georgia/')}>Georgia HOA rules page</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      The association statute is the Georgia Property Owners’ Association Act, Article 6 of Chapter 3
      of Title 44. The
      <a href="https://www.legis.ga.gov/laws" rel="noopener noreferrer">Georgia General Assembly laws page</a>
      did not return the code text during that review, so this page does not quote a section. A
      secondary reprint was not used as the statute.
    </p>
    <p>
      No statute found is not a statement that an association may not adopt a parking rule. The
      recorded instrument still has to be read. A city or county ordinance can still regulate parking.
    </p>
    <StateLots stateSlug="georgia" inputId="hoa-ga" />
    <section class="faq">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <>
          <h3>{faq.q}</h3>
          <p>{faq.a}</p>
        </>
      ))}
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
